A **provider** is a plugin that knows how to talk to one API (AWS, Google Cloud, GitHub, Cloudflare). A **resource** block declares one object that the provider manages.

```hcl
terraform {
  required_providers {
    aws = {
      source  = "hashicorp/aws"
      version = "~> 6.0"
    }
  }
}

provider "aws" {
  region = var.region
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "assets" {
  bucket = "example-assets-prod"
}
```

`terraform init` downloads providers and records the exact versions and checksums it selected in **`.terraform.lock.hcl`**. Commit that file, so every laptop and CI runner uses the same provider build and upgrades arrive as a reviewable diff.
